	"data": "9/3\n\nI haven't been very inspired lately to write or draw\nor fantasize. I think this comes down to a few things.\nFirst, whenever I am still I tend to go to my phone. I watch\nreels or talk to calculator or katie and do share creative thoughts\nthere but my creativity doesn't extend far outside those chats.\nSecond, I'm probably just in an energetic phase of low inspiration,\nI've been in them before and will likely reach that state\nof creative fervor again.\nI would like to write, draw, exercise,…",
